{"product_id":"copyediting-and-proofreading-for-dummies","title":"Copyediting and Proofreading For Dummies","description":"\u003cp\u003eTurn your knack for language into a lucrative careerMust-know techniques and resources for maximizing your accuracy and speedInterested in becoming a copyeditor or proofreader? Want to know more about what each job entails? This friendly guide helps you position yourself for success. Polish your skills, build a winning résumé and land the job you've always wanted. Books, magazines, Web sites, corporate documents - find out how to improve any type of publication and make yourself indispensable to writers, editors, and your boss. Balance between style and rules Master the art of the query Use proofreader symbols Edit and proof electronic documents Build a solid freelancing career\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 183 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Suzanne Gilad\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780470121719\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 384\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45481538355353,"sku":"10RF9780470121719","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6852c68542e8b-Copyediting-and-Proofreading-For-Dummies-Suzanne-Gilad-_1.jpg?v=1753121403","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/copyediting-and-proofreading-for-dummies","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}